WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
A traditional dhow rocks beside the Zanzibar shore.
Waves wash past weathered, reclaimed timber.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Two craftsmen lift and position a substantial
reclaimed timber board at a workshop bench.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
A craftsman's hands check a heavy wooden joint,
preserving the timber's aged grain and marks.
